WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Reversing requires special care. Confirm the area is clear and follow the approved site

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:24.000
procedure. Use the reversing signal with palms facing forward as illustrated. Stop the maneuver

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:36.000
if the driver loses sight of you or a blind spot becomes uncontrolled.

